sketch-1.bodyMarkdown:
A neighborhood makers market is replacing its launch spreadsheet with a small operational database.

You will carry one workspace through six milestones:

1. build the product catalog;
2. add the related stock-event ledger;
3. load approved products;
4. load opening stock events;
5. apply one approved product correction;
6. remove one confirmed placeholder event and produce the final handoff.

`schema.sql`, `seed.sql`, `operations.sql`, and `query.sql` keep separate responsibilities. Completed work carries forward at every milestone.
